This is a fork of https://github.com/Drake53/War3Net, from its master at v6.1.2 (5f6f7ba). It publishes three of
War3Net's packages under other ids, for Moonwell (https://github.com/mdlsvensson/moonwell):
Moonwell.War3Net.IO.Slk, Moonwell.War3Net.Build.Core and Moonwell.War3Net.Build. Their assemblies keep War3Net's names.

